Suggests: folio-post, libreoffice-impress-nogui | libreoffice-impress
Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: ribbon presentation program
 Folio Deliver is a presentation program with a ribbon interface, KeyTips,
 a File view, Slide Show and Presenter View, the standard desktop
 presentation keyboard shortcuts and .pptx as its native format, kept
 lossless: whatever it doesn't understand is saved back untouched.
